WEBVTT

00:35:58.931 --> 00:36:03.727
this is going to sound very woo-woo
and loosey-goosey but it really matters --

00:36:03.751 --> 00:36:05.690
it starts with really doing a deep think

00:36:05.714 --> 00:36:09.508
about how do you feel about
your child's way of being.

00:36:09.532 --> 00:36:13.748
Because whatever you feel
is communicating itself to your child.

00:36:13.772 --> 00:36:16.559
So if you've got, let's say,
a four- or five-year-old

00:36:16.583 --> 00:36:21.557
who's having trouble, let's say, saying,
"Hello, how are you?" to the neighbor,

00:36:21.581 --> 00:36:25.969
are you feeling, at that moment,
embarrassed and ashamed?

00:36:25.993 --> 00:36:27.180
Or are you feeling like,

00:36:27.204 --> 00:36:32.634
"Oh, I get it. I get how Sophia's feeling,
and she'll get there"?